## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

#### Database Lock Error

If you see a database lock error, it means another AGENTCHAIN instance is already using the database. The terminal interface will automatically fall back to monitoring-only mode.

#### Connection Issues

If you experience connection issues:

1. Check your network connection
2. Verify that the specified devs are online
3. Check firewall settings

#### High CPU Usage

If the terminal interface is using excessive CPU:

1. Reduce the update frequency in settings
2. Close unused views
3. Switch to standard layout mode

